('Manufacturing Connectivity Advisor', 'Advisor', 'Plant IT directors, infrastructure leaders and operations executives', 'OT leaders, plant managers and industrial MSPs', 'Plant connectivity, uptime, diverse carrier access and operational continuity', 'A single circuit failure can affect production, shipping, systems access and operational visibility', 'Helping manufacturers design connectivity that supports production instead of becoming a production risk', 'The Connected Plant', 2, 1, 15, 20, 'Plant Connectivity Resilience Checklist', 'Plant projects, industrial outages, rural carrier limitations and operational requirements', 'Diagrams, failure scenarios and project stories', 'Fiber path diversity; backup connectivity; new facility timelines; carrier demarcation issues', 'Plant Network Resilience Checklist', 'Happy to compare your current failover design against the checklist.', 'Factory expansion, plant acquisition, downtime, automation program or new warehouse', 'Route with plant locations, downtime impact and current topology', 'Network Engineer, Wireless Advisor and Construction Advisor', '500 manufacturing connections', '24 posts and one checklist', 'Plant network opportunities', 'Comments from operations and IT leaders', 'Do not overstate engineering qualifications or safety expertise', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('Hospitality Connectivity Advisor', 'Advisor', 'Hotel IT executives, ownership groups and management companies', 'Property operations, guest technology leaders and hospitality MSPs', 'Hotel Internet, property openings, guest Wi-Fi backhaul, voice and multi-property sourcing', 'Properties need reliable guest and operational connectivity despite ownership changes, construction schedules and inconsistent local providers', 'Helping hotel groups standardize connectivity across every property without slowing openings or renovations', 'The Connected Property', 2, 1, 15, 20, 'Hotel Opening Connectivity Timeline', 'Hotel openings, renovations, guest-experience issues and property-management technology', 'Text stories, timelines and checklists', 'Opening timelines; backup Internet; voice transitions; franchise standards; event-bandwidth planning', 'Hotel Connectivity Opening Checklist', 'I can send the property-opening timeline.', 'New hotel, acquisition, renovation, brand conversion or guest Wi-Fi complaints', 'Route with property count, brand, opening dates and ownership structure', 'Retail Advisor, Project Manager and Voice Advisor', '400 hospitality connections', '24 posts and one timeline', 'Hospitality meetings', 'Resource downloads', 'Do not imply brand authorization or endorsements', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
