('Field Services and Inside Wiring Advisor','Advisor','IT directors, facilities, construction and project managers','Low-voltage contractors and property managers','Demarc extensions, inside wiring, smart hands, site surveys and on-site coordination','Carrier service can be delivered to the building but still fail to reach the customer equipment','Helping teams close the gap between carrier handoff and usable service at the rack','The Last 100 Feet',2,1,15,20,'Site Readiness Checklist','Site surveys, wiring problems, demarcation issues and installation photos with permission','Annotated diagrams, photo lessons and checklists','MPOE versus demarc; fiber connectors; patching; power; rack readiness','Site Readiness Checklist','I can send the site-readiness sheet.','New office, circuit turn-up, construction, remote troubleshooting or failed activation','Route with address, handoff type, photos through secure channel and due date','Project Manager, Network Engineer and Construction Advisor','400 facilities and IT connections','24 posts and one checklist','Field-service opportunities','Site-checklist requests','Do not publish access instructions, security-sensitive photos or customer locations without approval',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('Customer Success and Escalations Advisor','Advisor','CIOs, IT directors and operations leaders','Carrier service managers and technology advisors','Service ownership, escalation, outage communications and customer lifecycle','Customers often feel abandoned after the order is signed and lack organized escalation paths','Helping organizations manage telecom after the sale, when service quality and accountability actually matter','What Happens After Installation',2,1,20,20,'Telecom Escalation Readiness Guide','Support experience, anonymized incidents and communication practices','Incident lessons, communication templates and customer stories','Escalation packets; ticket ownership; outage communication; SLA documentation','Telecom Escalation Readiness Guide','I can send the escalation checklist.','Repeated outages, unresolved tickets, billing errors or poor incumbent support','Route immediately when active incident exists; otherwise schedule service review','Carrier Relationship Advisor, Project Manager and Network Engineer','600 IT operations connections','24 posts and one guide','Service-management opportunities','Response quality and direct messages','Do not publicly litigate active disputes or reveal ticket data',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
